<b>Entry Level Behavioral Psychology</b>

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:41.790
<b>The Origins and History of Consciousness</b>

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:43.790
<i>for information on tickets to μ's concert.</i>

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:48.840
That's self-punishment.

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:52.620
It's a self-defense mechanism.

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:57.160
By punishing oneself, the individual 
hopes to avoid attacks from others.

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:01.810
<b>About Self Punishment</b>

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:07.350
Something's off.

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:14.250
What is it, Shikishima?

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:15.700
You can't solve it?

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:19.000
All right, that's enough.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:20.290
Return to your seat.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.930
<i>At first, I thought it was 
just a minor incongruity.</i>

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:32.520
<i>Yet the incongruity steadily grew,</i>

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:36.150
<i>invading my world with certainty.</i>

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:43.530
<i>The gears turning in my head 
steadily stopped meshing together.</i>

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:47.920
<i>They were supposed to be 
turning at the proper rhythm,</i>

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:52.190
<i>but it was as though all of sudden, 
they had ran out of machine oil.</i>

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:58.160
<i>All the gears composing 
the life I had been living</i>

00:16:58.900 --> 00:17:03.210
<i>began grating as they turned 
in a discordant rhythm.</i>

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.770
<i>When did I first feel this inconsistency?</i>

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:11.610
<i>I'm sure I had a chance 
to notice it much earlier,</i>

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:14.730
<i>yet why did I let that chance slip by?</i>

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:22.720
<b>Miyabi Municipal Kishimai High 
School Graduation Ceremony</b>

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:22.320
To all of you graduating,

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:25.910
congratulations on today.

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:29.080
Starting today, you all will be taking

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:31.930
your first new steps outside this school.

00:17:32.390 --> 00:17:38.820
I'm certain that a wonderful, 
rosy world awaits you all.

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:44.270
I pray from the bottom of 
my heart that happiness

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:46.330
shines down upon you all like starlight.

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:50.720
Next up, representing the graduating class,

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:53.340
Hibiki Kensuke of Class 3-3,
 with the formal address.

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.300
To those of you following after us,

00:17:55.720 --> 00:18:01.000
today we are celebrating this 
great day of our graduation.

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:03.980
If I were to close my eyes and look 
back on these past three years,

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:08.020
I would find nothing but fun 
memories wrapped in happiness.

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:12.760
And while I hope that that 
sentiment may carry on forever,

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:16.780
we would like to set forth 
into a new world once more.

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:21.190
This has been the graduate 
representative, Hibiki Kensuke.

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:32.620
<i>Aristotle writes, "To perceive is to suffer."</i>

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:39.130
<i>Up until now, I never held any doubts 
about my average, peaceful everyday life.</i>

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:40.870
<i>No, that's wrong.</i>

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:44.790
<i>Some part of my mind was 
avoiding those doubts.</i>

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:49.850
<i>Which means I was merely acting, 
pretending not to notice.</i>

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:55.190
<b>Miyabi Municipal Kishimai 
High School Entrance Ceremony</b>

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:55.190
<i>Yet once I perceived it, it became 
impossible to escape those incongruities.</i>

00:18:55.730 --> 00:19:01.460
<i>So just as every dream must end,
 no matter how long...</i>

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:10.570
<i>Eventually, a reality</i>

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:14.670
<i>that far surpasses what 
"incongruity" can express</i>

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:18.140
<i>bears it fangs.</i>

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:26.390
What on earth? What are you?

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:31.190
Can you hear me?

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:37.480
Uhh, I'm Hibiki Kensuke, 
representative of the new students.

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:42.110
We look forward to our 
time here, upperclassmen!

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:07.950
<i>When I was a child, I had nothing to fear.</i>

00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:08.410
μ...

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:15.200
<i>I believed that I was someone special.</i>

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:22.650
<i>I will change this world,</i>

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:27.880
<i>the way I want, with my own hands.</i>

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:31.660
<i>Now reach your hand out and take hold,</i>

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:35.040
<i>of the one and only me.</i>

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:38.800
<i>Sing my praises out loud,</i>

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:42.170
<i>about how special I am.</i>

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:45.950
<i>Don't be afraid, come close.</i>

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:52.970
<i>Love me, though I'm no one.</i>

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:53.950
Run!

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:57.610
What on earth is going on?!

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:58.440
I don't know!

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:05.150
<i>I don't want to accept that 
I'm the same as others.</i>

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:00.690
I don't know...

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:03.580
Shikishima-kun?

00:21:05.150 --> 00:21:12.840
<i>If I pretend not to see, and 
conveniently close my eyes,</i>

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:07.070
What's going on?

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:08.990
Huh? What's going?

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:13.080
H-Hey!

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:19.900
<i>I'll remain a child, never growing up.</i>

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.830
Hey!

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:18.240
Shikishima-kun, you keep acting strange!

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:19.900
Where are you going?!

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:23.060
This isn't the time to worry about where!

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:25.130
<i>I want to keep dreaming until I die.</i>

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:28.860
<i>Open your eyes, and reflect me,</i>

00:21:28.860 --> 00:21:32.280
<i>insignificant me.</i>

00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:36.350
<i>Wrap me up, and hold me tight,</i>

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:39.450
<i>as childish as I am.</i>

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:43.230
<i>Accept me in your arms</i>

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:50.920
<i>and love me, though I'll 
eventually disappear.</i>

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:51.740
What's happening?

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:58.280
What's happening?

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:07.350
Somebody explain this...

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:12.140
You murderer!

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:28.080
Shoot, it's already four o'clock?! What do I do?!

00:23:26.110 --> 00:23:41.000
<b>Episode 2
Anxiety, Irritation, and Other Such 
Negative Emotions Spread to Others</b>

00:23:28.080 --> 00:23:30.030
The limited-time sale on eggs is going to be over!

00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:34.680
Anxiety, irritation, and other such 
negative emotionsー

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:36.480
Forget the Caligula aphorisms!

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:37.740
Come with me, Club President!

00:23:37.740 --> 00:23:39.400
Then I can buy two packs!
